  "description": [
    {
      "ja": "『ダンボール戦機』より、LBXオーディーンが新たな変形ギミックを搭載しハイパーファンクションとして立体化！",
      "en": "From \"Danball Senki\", LBX Odin is equipped with a new transformation gimmick and becomes three-dimensional as a hyper function!"
    },
    {
      "ja": "• コアスケルトンには精密なメカディテールを再現。",
      "en": "• Precise mechanical details are reproduced on the core skeleton."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 多色成形で再現された各装甲はスムーズに着脱することができる。",
      "en": "• Each armor reproduced with multicolored molding can be smoothly attached and detached."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 飛行形態への変形は、各部位のパーツ構成にこだわり手首のみの差し替えで実現。",
      "en": "• Transformation into flight form is achieved by replacing only the wrists, with careful attention to the parts composition of each part."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 膝裏のバーニアを展開することで、脚部の可動域を大幅に確保。",
      "en": "• By deploying the vernier behind the knees, the range of motion of the legs is greatly ensured."
    },
    {
      "ja": "• 専用武器であるリタリエイターと４種の手首が付属。",
      "en": "• Special weapon Retaliator and 4 types of wrists are included."
    }
  ],
